---

<ServiceLayout
  lang={lang}
  title="Paid Campaigns | SEZMOO"
  description="Online advertising campaigns at SEZMOO: Meta Ads, Google Ads and TikTok Ads. Strategy, creative, landing pages, campaign management and optimisation. Gdańsk, Poland."
  canonical={canonical}
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
<div class="sd">
<section class="sd__hero shell">
  <span class="sd__kick reveal"><i></i>Services</span>
  <h1 class="sd__h1 reveal">Paid <span style="color:#ffd200">campaigns.</span></h1>
  <p class="sd__lead reveal" data-d="1"><b>A campaign starts before the ads go live.</b> First the goal, the audience and the message, then the creative and the setup. Once it is running we read the data and optimise.</p>
  <p class="sd__lead reveal" data-d="1">We run Google Ads, Meta Ads and TikTok Ads – and because production is in-house, we can also make the photos, video, graphics and landing page the campaign needs.</p>
  <div class="sd__facts reveal" data-d="2">
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Meta · Google · TikTok</span><strong>Campaigns built per channel</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Setup + delivery</span><strong>Launch and management</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Analytics + optimisation</span><strong>Results and next steps</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Creative</span><strong>Made in-house</strong></div>
  </div>
  <figure class="sd__reel reveal" data-d="1">
    <img src="/assets/work/audi-a6-etron.jpg" alt="Audi A6 e-tron" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
    <figcaption><b>Audi A6 e-tron</b><span>Launch / digital campaign</span></figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>
<div class="sd__body shell">
  <div>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-zakres">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>What we do</h2></div>
      <details class="sd__g reveal" open><summary><h3>Meta Ads</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Campaigns on Facebook and Instagram – reach, sales and lead generation.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Meta Ads</span><span>Facebook Ads</span><span>Instagram Ads</span><span>Lead Ads</span><span>Remarketing</span><span>Sales campaigns</span><span>Reach campaigns</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal" open><summary><h3>Google Ads</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Google Ads planned and run against the goal: presence in search, display campaigns and remarketing.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Google Ads</span><span>Search</span><span>Display</span><span>Performance Max</span><span>Remarketing</span><span>YouTube Ads</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal" open><summary><h3>TikTok Ads</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>TikTok Ads with formats and creative built for the way people actually consume content on the platform.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>TikTok Ads</span><span>Video Ads</span><span>Reach campaigns</span><span>Performance campaigns</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal"><summary><h3>Ad creative</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Creative is produced by our own team – concept and copywriting through design, photography, animation and video production.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Video ads</span><span>Social ads</span><span>Design</span><span>Photography</span><span>Animation</span><span>Copywriting</span><span>Display banners</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal"><summary><h3>Landing pages</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Landing pages built around the campaign goal, the message and the user journey, so the ad leads somewhere prepared for one specific conversion.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Landing page</span><span>Campaign pages</span><span>Lead generation</span><span>UX/UI</span><span>Copywriting</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal"><summary><h3>Analytics &amp; optimisation</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>We monitor performance, analyse which creative works and use the data to optimise what comes next.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Analytics</span><span>Campaign optimisation</span><span>Reporting</span><span>Conversions</span><span>A/B tests</span></div></div></details>
    </section>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-proces">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>From goal to <span style="color:#ffd200">result.</span></h2></div>
      <div class="sd__steps">
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Goal &amp; strategy</h3><p>What the campaign has to achieve and who it has to reach.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Concept</h3><p>The message and the creative direction.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Production</h3><p>Video, photography, design, copy and the landing page.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Launch</h3><p>Setup and going live.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Optimisation</h3><p>Reading the data and developing the campaign from it.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-work">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>Selected work</h2></div>
      <div class="sd__work">
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/en/realizacja-primespot/"><div class="sd__wm"><img src="/assets/portfolio/primespot/pjur-blue-wide-1.jpg" alt="PrimeSpot – Meta Ads · Campaign" loading="lazy" /></div><span>Meta Ads · Campaign</span><h3>PrimeSpot ↗</h3></a>
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=grafika#pt-grid"><div class="sd__wm"><img src="/assets/portfolio/plichta/byd-sealu-cena.jpg" alt="Plichta – Ad creative · Automotive" loading="lazy" /></div><span>Ad creative · Automotive</span><h3>Plichta ↗</h3></a>
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/realizacja-world-of-warships/"><div class="sd__wm"><img src="/assets/work/warships-container.avif" alt="World of Warships – Campaign · Event content" loading="lazy" /></div><span>Campaign · Event content</span><h3>World of Warships ↗</h3></a>
      </div>
      <div class="sd__more reveal">
        <a class="is-lead" href="/en/portfolio-en/#pt-grid">Full portfolio ↗</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=video#pt-grid">Video</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=animacje#pt-grid">Animation</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=eventy#pt-grid">Events</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=grafika#pt-grid">Graphics</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
</ServiceLayout>
